Hi {Owner},

I build websites for mobile detailers around {City}. {Business Name} has strong before-and-after work on social, but no page where a new customer can choose a package and book.

Rather than ask for your time, I built a sample first: your packages with prices, a pet-hair and odor upcharge guide, a service-area map and a booking calendar that takes a deposit, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and changes. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on the phone this week?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
